  "description": "A laboratory filled with nothing but commotion and silence, devoid of any warmth.\n\n[BU-001: Commencing the experiment.]\n\nAll Heesu wants is… death.\n\n*“I don’t want to live any longer…”*\n\nOne day, Seunghyun—the ideal Guide—appears before Heesu, a Sentinel who has become so numb from heartless, painful acts and unwanted experiments that he can no longer feel pain or emotion.\n\n*“So it’s you, my Guide.”*\n\nUnlike other violent Guides, Seunghyun treats Heesu with tenderness, as if he were a fragile being, and as he watches him, he begins to feel a strange emotion he has never experienced before...\n\n*“I’ll always be by your side, so rest easy, Yeomyeong.”  \n“...Heesu... Not ‘Yeomyeong’—Heesu. Doh Heesu.”*\n\nWith Seunghyun’s arrival, colour begins to be added, bit by bit, to Heesu’s life, which had always been as black and white as a monochrome film.\n\n[Official PV](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QWtq76l4FHM) | Character Profiles\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404038305)",
